                    <label style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px; display: block;"><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='16' height='16' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' style='vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 4px;'><path d='M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z'/><circle cx='12' cy='13' r='3'/></svg> عکس پروفایل:</label>
